-- The catalog in src/lib/data.ts grew from 226 to 391 books, but community data lives
-- in this table: a book with no row here cannot host a discussion, a save, or a
-- recommendation. Without this sync, 168 of the books a visitor can browse would
-- silently refuse every community action - the same failure that stranded five books
-- before the slug key was introduced.
--
-- Inserted with the slug already set so the catalog joins on it immediately. Titles,
-- authors and years are generated from the catalog itself. Descriptions are a neutral
-- placeholder; the app renders its own editorial copy and only falls back to this.
--
-- Safe to re-run: the unique index on slug makes the conflict clause a no-op for books
-- already present.

on conflict (slug) do nothing;
